   336→  \item \textit{Web Platform} (Next.js~16 + React~19): Nine interactive calculators covering 14 models from three providers, a 10-lesson context engineering course, a wiki with automated article aggregation, a dictionary of 41 terms, and dedicated browsing pages for the catalog (\texttt{/agents}, \texttt{/collections}, \texttt{/prompts}, \texttt{/instructions}, \texttt{/context-engineering}). A \texttt{/pro} landing page previews the planned enterprise tier (Section~\ref{sec:future}), and an \texttt{/extension} page documents the VS~Code extension's features.
