   338→  \item \textit{Context Engineering Catalog} (Markdown/YAML): A community-extensible collection of reusable agents, prompts, instructions, and collections. Artifacts are auto-discovered from \texttt{copilot-contribution/} and \texttt{user-content/} using file-extension conventions (\texttt{.agent.md}, \texttt{.prompt.md}, \texttt{.instructions.md}, \texttt{.collection.yml}); the catalog is seeded with curated examples and grows with community contributions.
