   250→Inside the extension, five layers work together:
   251→(1)~the \textit{Core Engine} (\texttt{contextMonitor.ts}) reacts to
   252→VS~Code editor events and builds \texttt{ContextSnapshot} records;
   253→(2)~the \textit{Tokenizer Service} (\texttt{tokenizerService.ts}) counts
   254→tokens using provider-specific BPE encoders;
   255→(3)~the \textit{Relevance Scorer} (\texttt{tabRelevanceScorer.pure.ts})
   256→assigns each tab a score $R \in [0,1]$;
   257→(4)~the \textit{Context Optimizer} closes tabs where $R < 0.3$; and
   258→(5)~the \textit{Chat Participant} (\texttt{contextChatParticipant.ts})
   259→exposes 11 slash commands.
